{"ID":"20240205153827-tri9y9w","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153827-tri9y9w","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153827-tri9y9w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092552-mp6vj4e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205160108-9jyz5kl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092552-mp6vj4e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:236,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:236\u0026#125;","title":"土茯苓","type":"doc","updated":"20240830163055"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206092552-mp6vj4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092552-mp6vj4e","updated":"20240206092559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东、浙江、湖南、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t干燥根茎为不规则块状，略呈扁圆柱形而弯曲不直，多分枝，有结节状隆起，长约5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 15cm，直径约25cm；表面土棕色或棕色，粗糙，常有刀伤切口及侧根残余部分，上端具茎痕；质坚硬，不易折断，断面粗糙，有粉性，淡棕色；气微，味甘淡。切片为长形薄片，大小不等，厚约13mm，边缘不整齐，淡红棕色或类白色；中间略具维管束点，仔细观察时可见砂砾样的光亮。纵切片常见花纹。导管不规则，富粉质，微有弹性，用水润湿后，手摸之有光滑感。\n【性味】\t甘、淡，平。\n【功效】\t解毒，除湿，利关节。治梅毒，淋浊，筋骨挛痛，脚气，疔疗疮，痈肿，瘰疬，梅毒及汞中毒所致的肢体拘挛，筋骨疼痛。\n【注解】\t“筋脉点”指药材组织内的纤维束或维管束。在整齐的药材切面上所表现的点状痕迹。"}]},{"ID":"20240206092546-z12iog0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092546-z12iog0","updated":"20240206092546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092546-vsftywg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160108-9jyz5kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160108-9jyz5kl","updated":"20240205160108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"土茯苓"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/土茯苓-20240205160108-vddepxu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710163200-8perxjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710163200-8perxjg","updated":"20240710164558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 482px;","style":"width: 472px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"土茯苓 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/土茯苓 3-20240710163200-r7ym3zb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 472px;\" parent-style=\"width: 482px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 440px;","style":"width: 430px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"土茯苓 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/土茯苓 14-20240710164558-z3jtcr5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 430px;\" parent-style=\"width: 440px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710162642-pbylflf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710162642-pbylflf","updated":"20240710163122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 271px;","style":"width: 261px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"土茯苓"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/土茯苓-20240710162642-pjbupiq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 261px;\" parent-style=\"width: 271px;